{title: Man Lafanga Bada}
{artist: Mohit Chauhan}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#] [D#],        Man lafanga bada
[C#] [D#],        Apne mann ki kare
[C#] [D#],        yoon toh mera hi hai
[C#] [D#],        Mujhse bhi na dare
[D#] [C#],        O bheege bheege khayalon mein dooba rahe
[D#] [C#],        Main sambhal ja kahun fisalta rahe
[C#],        Ishq mehnga pade
[G#] [D#],        Phir bhi sauda kare
[C#] [G#] [D#],        O jaane kyun udaasi isko pyari lage
[C#] [G#] [D#],        Chahe kyun nayi si koi isko beemari lage
[C#] [G#] [D#]
Bechaini raaton ki neelon mein aankhen jage
[C#] [G#] [D#],        Lamhaa har lamha kyun bojh sa bhaari lage
[G#],        O bhanwra sa ban ke machalta hai
[C#],        Bas tere peechhe peechhe chalta hai
[G#],        Junoon sa lahu mein ubalta hai
[C#],        Nuchha bebaat hi uchhalta hai
[D#] [C#],        O bheege bheege khayalon mein dooba rahe
[D#] [C#],        Main sambhal ja kahun fisalta rahe
[C#],        Ishq mehnga pade
[G#] [D#],        Phir bhi sauda kare
Repeat the same chords pattern for stanza below
O ambar ke paar ye jaane kya takta rahe
Badal ke gaon mein paakhi bhatakta rahe
Teri hi khushbu mein ye to mehekta rahe
Dheemi si aanch pe ishq sa pakta rahe,        O teri hi baaton se pighalta hai
Chai mein cheeni jaise ghulta hai,        Deewana aisa kahan milta hai
Pyaar mein yaaro sab chalta hai,        O bheege khayalon mein dooba rahe
Main sambhal ja kahun fisalta rahe,        Ishq mehenga pade
Phir bhi sauda kare,        Man lafanga bada
Apni mann ki kare..
